# Copy this file to wallet.txt and put YOUR Grin wallet address in it.
#
# wallet.txt is gitignored on purpose: a public repository should not tie the
# maintainer's identity to a wallet that receives mining income.
#
# Format: a single line with the address, optionally with a worker name:
#   grin1yourwalletaddressyoursyoursyoursyoursyoursyoursyoursyoursyours.RIG1
#
# Use it with the wallet guard so a tampered script cannot redirect your hashrate:
#   grinforge.exe --pool grin.2miners.com:3030 --user <wallet>.RIG1 --allow-address <wallet>
grin1replacewithyourownaddressreplacewithyourownaddressreplacewithyourow
